            "review_text": "Kanishk Nath\nKanpur, India76 contributions\n1\nAuthentic Vietnamese Restaurant\nMar 2024 • Friends\nAuthentic Vietnamese Restaurant in hanoi, we booked dinner at this restaurant and enjoyed lovely sea food, soup, chicken and beer. The staff were very welcoming and always smiling, good WiFi signals, but toilets need to be clean, 3 floor with lift facilities, middle of the hanoi street. If you are non vegetarian then must try this place.\nInsider tip:\nGood meals for Indian tourist, but need toilets to be clean and hygenic.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 13, 2024",
