            "review_title": "Review at Van Chai Marina",
            "review_text": "Paul\nMelton Mowbray, United Kingdom512 contributions\n0\nGood food in a nice setting.\nSep 2023 • Couples\nThis was the first dinner we had on our mercury trip. There was 18 of us, some with dietary needs. The meal was ok and was a good start tour our Vietnam food experience. \n\nAs you can see we had a set menu which came out thick and fast. I would say that this seems to be a thing in Vietnam that they want to get every starter, meal and additions out on to the table all at the same time. This wouldn't be a problem if the tables were massive, but they are not.\n\nI mentioned the dietary needs of some, Vegetarian, Nut allergy, no pork amongst others and this place seemed to struggle with the needs of some of the group. The options looked made up at the last minute and let the meal down for some.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 5, 2023",
